
---

## 🧹 `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# ========================
# Node / Frontend
# ========================
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.vite/
.env
.env.local
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ========================
# Python / Backend
# ========================
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.env
venv/
.venv/
pip-wheel-metadata/

# ========================
# FastAPI / Uvicorn
# ========================
*.log

# ========================
# MongoDB / Data
# ========================
data/
dump/

# ========================
# Uploads (user files)
# ========================
backend/uploads/*
!backend/uploads/.gitkeep

# ========================
# OS / Editor
# ========================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# ========================
# Testing / Coverage
# ========================
.coverage
htmlcov/
pytest_cache/

# ========================
# Misc
# ========================
*.sqlite3
